Package: benviplot
Title: Color Palettes and 'ggplot2' Extensions for Data Visualization
Version: 1.2.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Vinicius", "Oike", email = "viniciusoike@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8015-9189")),
    person("The Poppins Project Authors", role = "cph",
           comment = "Poppins font (SIL Open Font License 1.1), https://github.com/itfoundry/Poppins"))
Description: Provides 'ggplot2' scale functions and a custom theme derived from the
    'Benvi' visual identity of QuintoAndar Group. Offers qualitative, sequential,
    and diverging color palettes with both discrete and continuous scale variants.
